{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13225370","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13225370","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1322537001:0":{"text":"鱼又大又多的钓点？哦……我总能遇上你们这样的，鱼不多不大就怪钓点，呵呵……","source_cn":"鱼又大又多的钓点？哦……我总能遇上你们这样的，鱼不多不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37A31B5E29A574D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322537002:0":{"text":"不过人越少去的地方鱼越大嘛，我听说遗迹花海那边倒是不错，钓上来的鱼个顶个的大！","source_cn":"不过人越少去的地方鱼越大嘛，我听说遗迹花海那边倒是不错...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDDBE85DC405F7A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322537003:0":{"text":"不过路途遥远，你们要过去的话路上可要注意安全啊。","source_cn":"不过路途遥远，你们要过去的话路上可要注意安全啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4448CE4506CD30BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:钓鱼客":{"text":"钓鱼客","source":"钓鱼客","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}